# Keep rules for the FOC Stim RPC protobuf gencode (AGP 9.3+ keepRules source set).
#
# The protobuf-java runtime locates generated accessors (e.g.
# getNotificationBoot) reflectively via FieldAccessorTable. If R8 renames the
# generated classes/methods, every hasX()/getX()/getAllFields() call throws
# IllegalStateException ("missing method") in release builds only. Keep the
# whole generated package unrenamed, plus the runtime's reflective surface.
-keep class focstim_rpc.** { *; }
-keep class com.google.protobuf.** { *; }
